			"fileName": "useFfmpegOperations.ts",
			"wiki": "The `extractStreams` function within the `useFfmpegOperations` hook processes the list of streams. It constructs the necessary FFmpeg command-line arguments for each stream to extract it into a separate file using the `-map` argument.",
			"cellName": "FFmpeg Logic: Generate Extraction Commands - useFfmpegOperations.ts:L981-994",
