		"src/renderer/src/App.tsx-simstep-0f2dd1e9-88a7-4807-aa1a-26104ccc058b": {
			"path": "src/renderer/src/App.tsx-simstep-0f2dd1e9-88a7-4807-aa1a-26104ccc058b",
			"fileName": "App.tsx",
			"wiki": "In the renderer, the IPC event or a keyboard shortcut press is handled, which in turn calls the `detectBlackScenes` function obtained from the `useSegments` custom hook.",
