					"diagramNodeId": "8691ee96-a0c5-48fd-afe2-fe6acb16080d",
					"simStepLabel": "Finalize Operation and Update UI",
					"simStepDescription": "Back in the `userConcatFiles` function, the `finally` block executes, resetting the application's 'working' state. A success notification is then displayed to the user, confirming that the files have been merged.",
