			"description": "<ul><li>Allows users to join multiple video or audio files into a single file without re-encoding</li><li>- Files must have identical codec parameters (resolution, format, etc</li><li>) to be merged losslessly</li><li>- The application provides a dialog to select and order the files for concatenation</li><li>- It can automatically create chapters in the output file corresponding to each merged segment</li><li>- Includes a compatibility checker to warn users about potential mismatches between files</li></ul>",
			"simulationNodesAndEdges": {
