			"description": "<ul><li>Provides detailed control over the individual video, audio, subtitle, and data streams within a media file</li><li>- Users can view all available tracks and choose which ones to include in the exported file</li><li>- It allows for extracting all tracks from a file into separate files (e</li><li>g</li><li>, separating audio from video)</li><li>- Users can add new tracks from external files, such as adding a music track or a new subtitle file to a video</li><li>- Track metadata like language and disposition (e</li><li>g</li><li>, 'default', 'forced') can be edited</li></ul>",
			"simulationNodesAndEdges": {
