			"description": "<ul><li>Interoperability with other tools and workflows by importing and exporting cut segments in various standard formats</li><li>- Supports importing cut points from formats like CSV, YouTube Chapters, Final Cut Pro (XML), DaVinci Resolve, and CUE sheets</li><li>- Users can export their created segments to formats like CSV or SRT subtitles</li><li>- This allows for complex workflows where rough cuts are made in LosslessCut and then processed further in another application, or vice-versa</li><li>- Enables scripting and automation by preparing cut lists externally</li></ul>",
