			"description": "<ul><li>Automatically detects events in a video or audio file to create segments, saving significant manual effort</li><li>- Black scene detection can automatically create segments for all non-black portions of a video, useful for splitting content separated by fades</li><li>- Silent audio detection can identify and create segments to cut out silent parts of a recording</li><li>- Scene change detection analyzes video frames to automatically place cuts at the beginning of new scenes</li><li>- Users can also create segments from all keyframes in the video</li></ul>",
