					"diagramNodeId": "539e0294-749c-414f-a387-cea2990f7bd4",
					"simStepLabel": "Generate FFmpeg Metadata Arguments",
					"simStepDescription": "Inside the `losslessCutSingle` function (called by `cutMultiple`), the code iterates through the `customTagsByFile` object to generate an array of FFmpeg command-line arguments. It creates `-metadata` arguments for global tags and `-metadata:s:stream_index` arguments for per-track tags.",
