			"description": "<ul><li>Allows for modifying metadata embedded within the media file container and its individual tracks</li><li>- Users can edit file-level metadata like title, author, and comments</li><li>- It's also possible to edit per-track metadata, such as the title of an audio or subtitle track</li><li>- An intuitive tag editor displays existing tags and allows adding, editing, or removing them</li><li>- This is useful for organizing media libraries and ensuring correct information is displayed in media players</li></ul>",
			"simulationNodesAndEdges": {
