					"outputDataExample": "{\"sideEffect\": \"Open ConcatDialog with batch file data\"}"
				}
			],
			"description": "<ul><li>Streamlines workflows involving multiple media files</li><li>- Users can open an entire folder of files to be displayed in a batch list</li><li>- While the app doesn't support mass-exporting cuts for all files at once, it allows for quick switching between files in the batch list for sequential processing</li><li>- The primary batch operation is concatenation, where all files in the batch list can be merged into one</li><li>- This feature is useful for users who need to process a series of clips from a single recording session</li></ul>",
